[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Incident at Fortress 0984</h2>
<i>Guldan: ~wSee that SPU Commander and Warlord?</i><br>
<i>You: ~wYeah, and they mean trouble.</i><br>
<i>Guldan: ~wPerhaps not...You are getting some back up.</i><br>
<i>You: ~wCool, what rank is he?</i><br>
<i>Guldan: ~wYou mean she, and she is a rogue.</i><br>
<i>You: ~wGreat!</i><br>
<p>Make sure you friend doesn't die.  Also, kill the SPU's.

$Button=What you got,Tell,Show
$Button=Start the Fighting,Tell,Fight

[Show]
~rINCOMING ~wLINK:<br>
<i>?: ~wI am the Virtuos Warrior.  Listen, all you have to do is take out the commander, I will do the rest.<br>
REMEBER, get the commander.
$Button=Ok,ShowTechnology,55

[Fight]
~rINCOMING ~wLINK:<br>
<i>?: ~wI am the Virtuos Warrior.  Listen, all you have to do is take out the commander, I will do the rest.<br>
REMEBER, get the commander.
$Button=Ok,DoNothing,0

[Cool]
~rINCOMING ~wLINK<br>
The Virtuous One: I told you I would take care of them.  Now, a new threat arises.  SWORD is attacking my people, the ???.
$Button=Save Them,MissionBegin,FW8

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
As you listen to the Commander yell in agony, you hear a faint sound.  It gets louder and lounder until you run away screaming.  You look back to see the enemies disintegrate.  A large explosion rocks your island and throw's the enimies into the abyss.
$Button=Cool,Tell,Cool

[ai2PriestDead]
<i>^WaR^ Leader: You will die just like that member you let die...
$Button=Wait...What is this mystical Portal?,MissionBegin,FWT3

[ai3PriestDead]
<i>^WaR^ Leader: You will die just like that member you let die...
$Button=Wait...What is this mystical Portal?,MissionBegin,FWT3

[Failed]
<h2>You have failed</h2>
You are the screams of your people fade as everything becomes dark.
